LinkNote 0.2.0\par
\par
LinkNote is a local-first tool: you share a video link from your phone, your PC downloads/transcribes it with BiliNote, and the Markdown note is returned to your phone.\par
\par
Privacy:\par
- Video/audio, API keys and transcripts stay on your PC.\par
- The relay transfers the link, task status and the final Markdown. The Markdown is stored in the relay database so the phone can read it.\par
